  <item>
    <title>优势教练如何解读，才能说到别人心坎里？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658fc93eb8fd2bc0603cbf7a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658fc93eb8fd2bc0603cbf7a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Dec 2023 07:39:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你有找盖洛普优势教练解读过盖洛普报告吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你认为教练怎么解读，才能说到你的心坎里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客就来分享一下走心的解读需要满足的4点标准，新手教练可以参考这4个维度来给自己打分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为消费者，也可以参考这个标准，找到靠谱的优势教练。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 为什么找过教练解读，却感觉没有用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 能说到人心坎里的解读，叶叶总结的4点标准：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 标准一：准，怎么才能提高解读的精准度？</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.1 对才干的精准理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 举例子：以完美才干解读为例，好多小伙伴说太有共鸣了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 排难才干解读，让好多人重新欣赏排难的优势</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.2 对才干组合的精准理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 分析+体谅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a> 取悦+交往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 和谐+排难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 前瞻+理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 前瞻+回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 正版盖洛普报告和盗版的区别，为什么要做正版测试？</span></p><span></span><p><span>标准二：理解接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 遇到不喜欢自己才干的客户，示范一个错误的回应方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 以不喜欢自己的和谐才干为例，教练该怎么理解对方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 标准三：鼓舞点亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么点亮对方的信心，让对方欣赏自己未曾发现的闪光点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3111">51:51</a> 标准四：思路打开</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么提问定位到真正的问题，打开解决问题的思路？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果想要成为优势教练，或者找我的教练班学员体验公益解读，或者做盖洛普测试，请添加微信咨询～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FveKs-HpqeuKyNa75zVP0dijL0X5.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
